  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Transaction / trace explorer\n1. Paste a **transaction_id** into the variable at the top. The log panel runs `{service=~\"petabyte-.*\"} | json | transaction_id=\"$transaction_id\"` across every service.\n2. Each log line's `trace_id` is a **link to Tempo** (derived field). Click it, or paste the id into **trace_id** to render the trace below.\n3. The stat panels summarise the transaction's state, payment mode and settlement milestones \u2014 all derived from the structured logs.\n\n> High-cardinality ids (transaction_id, job_id, trace_id, buyer_id, seller_id, gpu_id) live in the **JSON log body**, not as Loki labels."
      },
      "datasource": null
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Current state (to_state)",
      "description": "Latest to_state from transaction.transition logs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "last_over_time({service=~\"petabyte-.*\",environment=\"$environment\"} | json | transaction_id=\"$transaction_id\" | event_name=\"transaction.transition\" | unwrap_label to_state [$__range])",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
